WEBVTT

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.830
Unpolished great talent.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:17.410
Once a phenom, but not any longer.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.870
Former child prodigy.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:22.330
Forgotten genius, Kensei Maeshima.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.490
The one who called him back
to the ice after many years

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.870
was Reo Shinozaki, whom he
one-sidedly considered a rival,

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:33.040
and me, Hayato Sasugai,
a fine and upstanding person.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.990
However...

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.830
So, I, Kensei Maeshima,
goofed around a lot yesterday,

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:44.040
but I'm going to formally join
the skate-leading club! Thank you!

